{title: Beautiful Dreamer}
{artist: Stephen Foster}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}
{tempo: 92}
{meta: public_domain Words and music by Stephen Foster, published 1864.}
{meta: source Sheet music, Wm. A. Pond & Co., New York, 1864.}
{meta: arrangement Original chord arrangement for Fretlight}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Beautiful dreamer, [C]wake unto [G7]me,[G7]
[G7]Starlight and dewdrops are [G7]waiting for [C]thee;[C]
[C]Sounds of the rude world, [C]heard in the [G7]day,[G7]
[G7]Lull'd by the moonlight have [G7]all pass'd a[C]way![C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Beautiful dreamer, [F]queen of my [C]song,[C]
[D7]List while I woo thee with [D7]soft melo[G7]dy;[G7]
[C]Gone are the cares of [C]life's busy [G7]throng,[G7]
[G7]Beautiful dreamer, a[G7]wake unto [C]me![C]
{end_of_chorus}
